{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Pinch"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Sample Code","title":"Interaction — Pinch","modules":[{"name":"Swami"}],"role":"sampleCode"},"kind":"article","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Related Documentation","identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/OrigamiMappings"],"anchor":"Related-Documentation"},{"anchor":"Patterns","title":"Patterns","identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Drag"],"generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Preview","level":2,"text":"Preview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"The-patch","level":2,"text":"The patch"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Origami drives this with an "},{"code":"origami.PopSwitch","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — a remembered on\/off state — flipped by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a pinch and fed into a Transform Scale. There’s no helper to reach for: it maps straight"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"onto native SwiftUI, which is the reusable idea worth taking away. A "},{"code":"MagnifyGesture","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reads the pinch, a "},{"code":"@State","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" flag flips at a threshold, and a "},{"code":".spring","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" animates the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scale between the two states (see the State\/memory → "},{"code":"@State","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" row in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/OrigamiMappings","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["@State private var popped = false","","RoundedTriangle(cornerRadius: 20)","    .frame(width: 90, height: 80)","    .scaleEffect(popped ? 2 : 1)","    .animation(.spring(response: 0.35, dampingFraction: 0.7), value: popped)","    .gesture(","        MagnifyGesture().onEnded { value in","            if value.magnification > 1.25 { popped = true }","            else if value.magnification < 0.8 { popped = false }","        }","    )"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The pop is the point: a discrete state the gesture toggles, animated with a spring — not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a scale that tracks your fingers continuously.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"How-its-built","level":2,"text":"How it’s built"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The full view sits the white rounded triangle on the magenta artboard and adds a live"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"@GestureState","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" so the shape follows your fingers mid-pinch before it settles on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"popped state. Read the source (below) for the whole thing."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Behavior","level":2,"text":"Behavior"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pinch out on the shape to grow it; pinch in to shrink it."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Cross the threshold and it snaps to the next size with a spring, rather than","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracking your fingers continuously.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The switch remembers its state, so a release between pinches holds the current size."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Downloads","level":2,"text":"Downloads"},{"type":